    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b31a6f10a00972bd6be666f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看来我开上高速公路比想像中还顺利呢！\n这样应该拿得到驾照吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb899f41dc85eecaeb1fe941ab82c92fdfaa63c4479e6b5c2a084ab791f6a525",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104520.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e27bb8c4194eae2d10e12ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你还缺乏安全驾驶的技术",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e07bdfe6ac78d9cd7d77b4cb0468f238c557202db421e8daf646dfe31e62038",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104520.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb0254e334fc2a068bf9bd6a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不压抑住斗争心的话会很危险",
      "source_fingerprint": "df2a3964a8f73a998a785eabdfc6d1d83e4eed4aab3258cc6c88c6bf86bedd21",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104520.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfc4c8a7f67083c3075a2ef0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "先不说驾驶技术如何，\n绝对不能忽视安全驾驶这件事。\n这时候我必须好好说几句。",
      "source_fingerprint": "780858ecde744d5f350b6df6fd59f04426ea8fa67751a86cc7d9430895001e40",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104520.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f9f108517ff2c4d1fca664e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "公共道路上还有其他汽车行驶，\n我告诉她们要时时意识这一点，\n冷静驾驶是安全驾驶最重要的技术。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa2d614e76a8cdb47b130d6bd167488e7aecc74091e7271094b04cee32fe76cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104520.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b0cb5478aab97806ce14aa9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1e4f90b59d679f54f3a8c84a8c11fe55f91cf86a898da433bbfe74a988804c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104520.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25a49eafe57ffd370cc4fa2b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样啊……家乡的车子不多，\n开在路上时几乎都只有我而已，\n我忽略了其他驾驶员的立场……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5867d83c92bc62c57a75beaad31e1937a027307851f5b91f5fde1316190e6822",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104520.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75b0235725e0de9cd1a4b087",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1e4f90b59d679f54f3a8c84a8c11fe55f91cf86a898da433bbfe74a988804c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
