    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33db43da08710ae4f76d4dc7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下次坐别人的车时，\n我会仔细看看其他人如何驾驶！\n驾照就等之后再说吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25703c0bbbf7c0f17a84995137fb4da605faa82baa566b1ecfa5d990881af653",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104520.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4267c1a1182449fff5b67b7a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要她愿意安全驾驶我就安心了，\n在她学会如何安全驾驶之前，\n就先在她身边支持她吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cacdf3d348981b3c83468b5e548c0c7a2f1a1cb5cfa59e06fd9af31ec0863057",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104520.json",
      "json_path": [
