    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e163ab296bfd75287b785001",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样啊……嗯，说得也是。\n在公共道路上竞争是很危险的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cbbb4b9f32b2174b6c7c89a96b4b6081f7aacfce243421c660bd052958818b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104520.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9c50243c7339a1e20ab155c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "把斗争心留到关键时刻再用吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9b86c6a7a52fc44c36cdbe4b7c50bf3874cfbf15f40a63da658fa747b5578cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104520.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
