    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58154561a7d3f004f51286a1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了能够冷静地开车，\n我要更加锻炼精神力才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f2955471a3b884183bd8e4c0437f3389d390adedba7e43b3db1ee049f66e238",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104520.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c924dcb6059a43854f1430f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然或许是条艰难的道路，\n但为了让她能实现目标，我会支持着她。",
